        "payload": {
          "declaration": "theorem M7.Connectivity.one_mem_top : ∀ (N : ℕ) [NeZero N] (H : AddSubgroup (ZMod N)), (1 : ZMod N) ∈ H ↔ H = ⊤ := by\n  change ∀ (N : ℕ) [NeZero N] (H : AddSubgroup (ZMod N)), (1 : ZMod N) ∈ H ↔ H = ⊤\n  intro N inst H\n  constructor\n  · intro h\n    apply le_antisymm le_top\n    intro x hx\n    simpa only [mul_one] using M7.Connectivity.scalar_mem N H 1 x h\n  · intro h\n    rw [h]\n    trivial",
